   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has successfully domesticated coffee for smallholder garden production, thereby increasing income and improving livelihoods. This approach has been replicated and scaled by larger organisations, including SOS Sahel and various local district offices in relation to other significantly larger projects of FARM Africa, in at least four projects with agroforestry components ranging between DKK 181k and 540k.</narrative>
